sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Customer
    participant API as Go API (Coordinator)
    participant PG as Central PostgreSQL
    participant B as Participant Bank
    participant W as Recovery Worker

    C->>API: POST /payments (Idempotency-Key)
    API->>PG: Create payment + durable saga state
    API->>B: HOLD / PROVISIONAL_CREDIT (deterministic op_id)
    Note over API,B: Response lost / timeout
    API-->>C: 202 / PENDING_RECONCILIATION
    W->>PG: Claim stale recovery job (lease + epoch)
    W->>B: GetOperationStatus(op_id)
    alt Bank confirmed settled
        B-->>W: SETTLED
        W->>PG: Repair central ledger -> COMPLETED
    else Definite failure
        B-->>W: FAILED
        W->>B: Release / Reverse hold
        W->>PG: Mark REVERSED / FAILED
    else Still unknown
        B-->>W: UNKNOWN
        W->>PG: Retain PENDING_RECONCILIATION
    end
